19:T4eb,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there one Tsinghua scholarship deadline?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Do not assume so. The graduate instructions describe department-specific deadlines and batches, and funding notices can have their own timelines. Check both the programme and the exact scholarship."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the graduate application free if I apply for CSC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The checked general graduate fee guidance states RMB 800 and says the Chinese Government Scholarship does not cover that application charge. Only a verified specific exception should be treated differently."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use a universal IELTS score from a scholarship blog?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Use the programme catalogue and department instructions instead. Language requirements and accepted evidence can differ by programme."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a department recommendation guarantee a scholarship?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Academic evaluation, recommendation or nomination and the final funding decision are distinct stages. Read the current route’s rules."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide china-page","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/tsinghua-university-admissions-scholarships/\",\"name\":\"Tsinghua University admissions and scholarships for international students\",\"description\":\"Compare Tsinghua admission and scholarship routes, department requirements, the graduate application fee and verified cycle status before applying.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/tsinghua-university-admissions-scholarships/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":